    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the Secrets of Dr. Wilfried \u00c9ric Herreshoff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a determined police officer investigating a chilling mystery in a small, storm-battered town. Reports of strange accidents and whispered rumors lead you to the Herreshoff Estate. But beneath the surface of his prestigious reputation lies a web of secrets darker than the storm outside.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359610/extras/0b8a0affb0cc2b7943019d092f2754f9.poster.avif?t=1734426909\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359610/extras/0b8a0affb0cc2b7943019d092f2754f9.webm?t=1734426909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359610/extras/0b8a0affb0cc2b7943019d092f2754f9.mp4?t=1734426909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this atmospheric puzzle game, you'll explore the doctor\u2019s meticulously preserved mansion, uncover cryptic diary entries, and piece together a story of desperation, obsession, and the haunting legacy of a family curse. What horrors has Dr. Herreshoff unleashed in his pursuit of a cure?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359610/extras/d01ff9e873ad2fa02d4ea84c6a251b5a.poster.avif?t=1734426909\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359610/extras/d01ff9e873ad2fa02d4ea84c6a251b5a.webm?t=1734426909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359610/extras/d01ff9e873ad2fa02d4ea84c6a251b5a.mp4?t=1734426909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Storytelling: Discover the tragic tale of Dr. Herreshoff through his journals, family portraits, and eerie remnants of the past.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense Exploration: Investigate a rain-drenched mansion filled with unsettling details, hidden compartments, and cryptic clues.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-Driven Gameplay: Solve challenging puzzles, navigate moral dilemmas, and uncover hidden truths about the Herreshoff family.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Design: Experience a blend of dark, brooding visuals and haunting soundscapes that pull you into the stormy night.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist Herreshoff's Legacy\u00a0now and uncover the truth waiting in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359610/extras/2b71a8c69ad3cb9cbbe633c42b7917f8.avif?t=1734426909\" data-has-big width=800 height=326 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the Secrets of Dr. Wilfried \u00c9ric Herreshoff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a determined police officer investigating a chilling mystery in a small, storm-battered town. Reports of strange accidents and whispered rumors lead you to the Herreshoff Estate. But beneath the surface of his prestigious reputation lies a web of secrets darker than the storm outside.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359610/extras/0b8a0affb0cc2b7943019d092f2754f9.poster.avif?t=1734426909\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359610/extras/0b8a0affb0cc2b7943019d092f2754f9.webm?t=1734426909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359610/extras/0b8a0affb0cc2b7943019d092f2754f9.mp4?t=1734426909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this atmospheric puzzle game, you'll explore the doctor\u2019s meticulously preserved mansion, uncover cryptic diary entries, and piece together a story of desperation, obsession, and the haunting legacy of a family curse. What horrors has Dr. Herreshoff unleashed in his pursuit of a cure?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359610/extras/d01ff9e873ad2fa02d4ea84c6a251b5a.poster.avif?t=1734426909\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359610/extras/d01ff9e873ad2fa02d4ea84c6a251b5a.webm?t=1734426909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359610/extras/d01ff9e873ad2fa02d4ea84c6a251b5a.mp4?t=1734426909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Storytelling: Discover the tragic tale of Dr. Herreshoff through his journals, family portraits, and eerie remnants of the past.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense Exploration: Investigate a rain-drenched mansion filled with unsettling details, hidden compartments, and cryptic clues.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-Driven Gameplay: Solve challenging puzzles, navigate moral dilemmas, and uncover hidden truths about the Herreshoff family.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Design: Experience a blend of dark, brooding visuals and haunting soundscapes that pull you into the stormy night.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist Herreshoff's Legacy\u00a0now and uncover the truth waiting in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359610/extras/2b71a8c69ad3cb9cbbe633c42b7917f8.avif?t=1734426909\" data-has-big width=800 height=326 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
